# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment upload.
#
# Vercel uploads the working directory, not the git tree, so build artifacts that
# .gitignore keeps out of the repo are still sent unless they are listed here.
#
# solana/ is what forced this file to exist: `vercel --prod` failed with
# "Unknown system error -102" on solana/winscore-wager/test-ledger/admin.rpc,
# a Unix socket left behind by a local solana-test-validator. Sockets are not
# regular files and cannot be packaged. The same tree also carries ~3 GB of Rust
# build output that the Next.js build never reads — the one file it needs, the
# program IDL, is committed under solana/winscore-wager/idl/ and re-included below.

# Rust/Anchor workspace: local validator ledger (contains a Unix socket), Rust
# build output, and Anchor caches.
solana/winscore-wager/test-ledger
solana/winscore-wager/target
solana/winscore-wager/.anchor
!solana/winscore-wager/idl

# Container build context — Vercel builds from source, not the Dockerfile.
docker

# Specs and agent tooling: documentation, never imported at build or runtime.
openspec
.superpowers
.agents
.codex
.opencode
.qodo
